                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Played remote play together on a couple of people's games, so my time isn't accurate. I actually have around 1 or 2 hours playing this game\n\nPros:\n- Gameplay - Hard to master ship controlling. I still suck at controlling the ship, but I'm certain you can fly it well if you practice enough. Gives you a challenge\n- Level Design - Each level brings a unique way to play, makes each level feel like a whole new game mode\n\nCons:\n- Lack of Levels - With 7 levels, it could make the game feel repetitive if you play for a lengthy amount of time\n- No Online Support - Peer to Peer would be great, but the only way you can play with your online buddies is Remote Play Together",
